    lines += ['', 'All four full-cohort matched comparisons clear the requested overall+0.0002 point threshold. On the20% horizon sample, boosted-beyond-existing gains only+0.000144 and fails the screening threshold; logistic-beyond-existing gains+0.000660. Full-cohort results are reported for the fixed requested models, including this screening failure; they are not a promotion of a failed screen.','', '## Comparison against the original scores','', '|Cohort|Arm|Original AUC|Candidate AUC|Gain|Paired95% interval|','|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---|']
    for cohort,key in [('Horizon simplified blend','horizon'),('Saved full V53 day6','saved_v53')]:
        for x in ref[key]:lines.append(f'|{cohort}|{x["arm"]}|{x["control_auc"]:.9f}|{x["candidate_auc"]:.9f}|{x["delta"]:+.9f}|{x["paired95"][0]:+.9f} to {x["paired95"][1]:+.9f}|')
    lines += ['', 'The day6 untouched V53 weighted AUC is0.820037962. Its strongest two-part replacement, logistic-augmented, reaches0.818817715: a loss of0.001220247. Thus positive gains over conditional-choice or reduced summary controls must not be described as a gain on top of V53. On the horizon, logistic-augmented is only+0.000274 over the original simplified blend, and its20% sample score is below that original baseline.','', '## Horizon arrival and history groups','', 'Arrival and history bins below overlap; do not sum them. Weights match normalized arrival67:17:7:4 and history1.26%/16.37%/82.37%, preserving the observed association. Evaluation arrivaldays5–7 are unsupported. Full-cohort uncertainty uses200 paired user bootstraps; screening uses400. Model, calibration and IPF weights stay fixed during resampling.','']
